              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E’yo drinzaruri eri nya azi ama a’bipi ma dri pamvunini, engazu ewu amani ovuzu ’ba o’diru­risi, kabilo yini pie, ti yini pie, agianzi yini pie, ezoanzi yini pie. ",
          "type": "text",
